{"subject":"math","year":2010,"count":23,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math-2010-1","num":1,"desc":"$1^\\infty$ 型极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C.","【详解】方法一：","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac{x^{2}}{(x-a)(x+b)}\\right)^{x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}e^{\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{x^{2}}{(x-a)(x+b)}\\right)^{x}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}e^{x\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{x^{2}}{(x-a)(x+b)}\\right)}$","$=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}e^{x\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac{x^{2}}{(x-a)(x+b)}-1\\right)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}e^{x\\left(\\dfrac{x^{2}}{(x-a)(x+b)}-1\\right)}$","$=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}e^{x\\left(\\dfrac{(a-b)x+ab}{(x-a)(x+b)}\\right)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}e^{\\dfrac{(a-b)x^{2}+abx}{(x-a)(x+b)}}$","$=e^{a-b}$","方法二：本题是 $1^{\\infty}$ 型极限","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac{x^{2}}{(x-a)(x+b)}\\right)^{x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}e^{x\\left(\\dfrac{x^{2}}{(x-a)(x+b)}-1\\right)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}e^{\\dfrac{(a-b)x^{2}+abx}{(x-a)(x+b)}}=e^{a-b}.$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-2","num":2,"desc":"隐函数存在定理","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】B.","$F\\left(\\dfrac{y}{x},\\dfrac{z}{x}\\right)=0.$","等式两边对 $x$ 求偏导，得 $F_{1}'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{y}{x^{2}}\\right)+F_{2}'\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{z}{x^{2}}+\\dfrac{1}{x}\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right)=0$  (1)","等式两边对 $y$ 求偏导，得 $F_{1}'\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{x}+F_{2}'\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{x}\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=0$  (2)","$(1)\\times x^{2}+(2)\\times xy$ 得 $\\left(x\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}+y\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}\\right)F_{2}'=zF_{2}'$，所以 $x\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}+y\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=z.$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-3","num":3,"desc":"反常积分敛散性判别","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】D.","【详解】显然 $x=0, x=1$ 是两个瑕点，有","$\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^{2}(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}dx=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^{2}(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}dx+\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{1}\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^{2}(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}dx$, 对于 $\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^{2}(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}dx$ 的瑕点","$x=0$，当 $x\\to0^{+}$ 时 $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^{2}(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}=\\ln^{\\frac{2}{m}}(1-x)x^{-\\frac{1}{n}}$ 等价于 $(-1)^{\\frac{2}{m}}x^{\\frac{2}{m}-\\frac{1}{n}}$，而 $\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}x^{\\frac{2}{m}-\\frac{1}{n}}dx$ 收","敛(因对任意正整数 $m,n$ 有 $\\dfrac{1}{n}-\\dfrac{2}{m}<1$)，故 $\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^{2}(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}dx$ 收敛；对 $\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{1}\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^{2}(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}dx$","的瑕点 $x=1$，$x\\in(1-\\delta,1)\\left(0<\\delta<\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)$ 时, $\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^{2}(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}<2^{\\frac{1}{n}}\\ln^{\\frac{2}{m}}(1-x)<2^{\\frac{1}{n}}(1-x)^{\\frac{2}{m}}$,","而 $\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{1}(1-x)^{\\frac{2}{m}}dx$ 显然收敛，故 $\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{1}\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^{2}(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}dx$ 收敛. 所以选择 D."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-4","num":4,"desc":"二重积分的定义（黎曼和）","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】D.","【详解】","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\sum\\limits_{j=1}^{n}\\dfrac{n}{(n+i)(n^{2}+j^{2})}=\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\dfrac{1}{\\left(1+\\dfrac{i}{n}\\right)}\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{j=1}^{n}\\dfrac{1}{\\left(1+\\left(\\dfrac{j}{n}\\right)^{2}\\right)}\\dfrac{1}{n}=$","$\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{1}{(1+x)(1+y^{2})}dy.$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-5","num":5,"desc":"矩阵秩的不等式","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】A","【详解】由于 $\\boldsymbol{AB}=\\boldsymbol{E}$ 所以 $R(\\boldsymbol{AB})=m$,","又 $R(\\boldsymbol{AB})=m\\leqslant\\min(R(\\boldsymbol{A}),R(\\boldsymbol{B}))$ 即 $R(\\boldsymbol{A})\\geqslant m, R(\\boldsymbol{B})\\geqslant m$,","$R(\\boldsymbol{A})\\leqslant m, R(\\boldsymbol{B})\\leqslant m, R(\\boldsymbol{A})=m, R(\\boldsymbol{B})=m$."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-6","num":6,"desc":"实对称矩阵的相似对角化","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】D.","【详解】设 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的特征值为 $\\lambda$，则由 $\\boldsymbol{A}^{2}+\\boldsymbol{A}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 可得 $\\lambda$ 满足关系式 $\\lambda^{2}+\\lambda=0$","即 $\\lambda(\\lambda+1)=0\\Rightarrow\\lambda=0$ 或 $\\lambda=-1$, 且 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 为实对称矩阵，必可相似对角化.","又因为 $R(\\boldsymbol{A})=3$, 对角阵的秩也是 3. 所以 $\\lambda=-1$ 是三重特征根，","故 $\\boldsymbol{A}\\sim\\begin{pmatrix}-1&&&\\\\&-1&&\\\\&&-1&\\\\&&&0\\end{pmatrix}$，所以正确答案为（D）."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-7","num":7,"desc":"分布函数与点概率的计算","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C.","【详解】$P\\{x=1\\}=P\\{x\\leqslant1\\}-P\\{x<1\\}=F(1)-F(1-0)=1-e^{-1}-\\dfrac{1}{2}=\\dfrac{1}{2}-e^{-1}$","所以选 C."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-8","num":8,"desc":"概率密度的归一性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】A.","【详解】由概率密度的性质 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}f(x)dx=1$，有","$a\\int_{-\\infty}^{0}f_{1}(x)dx+b\\int_{0}^{3}f_{2}(x)dx=1\\Rightarrow\\dfrac{1}{2}a+\\dfrac{3}{4}b=1\\Rightarrow2a+3b=4$","所以选 A."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-9","num":9,"desc":"参数方程确定的函数求二阶导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】0.","【详解】","$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+t^{2})}{-e^{-t}}$","$\\dfrac{d^{2}y}{dx^{2}}=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\\right)=\\dfrac{d}{dt}\\left(\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\\right)\\dfrac{dt}{dx}=\\left(\\dfrac{\\ln(1+t^{2})}{-e^{-t}}\\right)'\\dfrac{1}{x'(t)}$","$=-\\dfrac{\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^{2}}e^{-t}+\\ln(1+t^{2})e^{-t}}{\\left(e^{-t}\\right)^{2}}\\times\\dfrac{1}{-e^{-t}}=e^{2t}\\left(\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^{2}}+\\ln(1+t^{2})\\right)$","$\\Rightarrow\\dfrac{d^{2}y}{dx^{2}}\\Big|_{t=0}=0$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-10","num":10,"desc":"定积分换元法","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$-4\\pi$","【详解】令 $\\sqrt{x}=t$, 原式为","$2\\int_{0}^{\\pi}t^{2}\\cos t\\,dt=2\\left(t^{2}\\sin t\\big|_{0}^{\\pi}-\\int_{0}^{\\pi}2t\\sin t\\,dt\\right)=-4\\int_{0}^{\\pi}t\\sin t\\,dt=4\\left(t\\cos t\\big|_{0}^{\\pi}-\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\cos t\\,dt\\right)=-4\\pi$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-11","num":11,"desc":"第二类曲线积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】0.","【详解】令 $L_{1}:\\begin{cases}x=t\\\\ y=1+t\\end{cases}, -1\\leqslant t\\leqslant0$, $L_{2}:\\begin{cases}x=t\\\\ y=1-t\\end{cases}, 0\\leqslant t\\leqslant1$,","$\\int_{L}xy\\,dx+x^{2}dy=\\int_{L_{1}}xy\\,dx+x^{2}dy+\\int_{L_{2}}xy\\,dx+x^{2}dy=\\int_{-1}^{0}t(1+t)+t^{2}\\,dt+\\int_{0}^{1}t(1-t)-t^{2}\\,dt$","$=\\left(\\dfrac{2}{3}t^{3}+\\dfrac{t^{2}}{2}\\right)\\Big|_{-1}^{0}+\\left(\\dfrac{t^{2}}{2}-\\dfrac{2}{3}t^{3}\\right)\\Big|_{0}^{1}=0$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-12","num":12,"desc":"三重积分（柱面坐标）","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{2}{3}.$","【详解】$\\bar{z}=\\dfrac{\\iiint\\limits_{\\Omega}z\\,dxdydz}{\\iiint\\limits_{\\Omega}dxdydz}=\\dfrac{\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{1}rdr\\int_{r^{2}}^{1}z\\,dz}{\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{1}rdr\\int_{r^{2}}^{1}dz}=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}}{\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}}=\\dfrac{2}{3}.$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-13","num":13,"desc":"向量组的秩","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\alpha=6.$","【详解】由题意知向量组 $\\alpha_{1},\\alpha_{2},\\alpha_{3}$ 线性相关，而其中两个向量线性无关，所以","$R(\\alpha_{1},\\alpha_{2},\\alpha_{3})=2$","$\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&2\\\\ 2&1&1\\\\ -1&0&1\\\\ 0&2&\\alpha\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow[\\;r_{3}+r_{1}\\;]{\\;r_{2}-2r_{1}\\;}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&2\\\\ 0&-1&-3\\\\ 0&1&3\\\\ 0&2&\\alpha\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow[\\;r_{4}+2r_{2}\\;]{\\;r_{3}+r_{2}\\;}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&2\\\\ 0&-1&-3\\\\ 0&0&0\\\\ 0&0&\\alpha-6\\end{pmatrix}$","故 $\\alpha-6=0\\Rightarrow\\alpha=6$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-14","num":14,"desc":"离散型分布律的归一性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】2.","【详解】由概率密度的性质 $\\sum\\limits_{k=0}^{\\infty}P\\{X=k\\}=1$，有 $\\sum\\limits_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{C}{k!}=1\\Rightarrow C=e^{-1}$，即","$P\\{X=k\\}=\\dfrac{e^{-1}}{k!}, k=0,1,2,\\cdots$ 为参数为 1 的泊松分布，则有","$EX=1, DX=1\\Rightarrow EX^{2}=DX+(EX)^{2}=2.$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-15","num":15,"desc":"二阶常系数非齐次线性微分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】齐次方程 $y''-3y'+2y=0$ 的特征方程为 $\\lambda^{2}-3\\lambda+2=0$ 由此得","$\\lambda_{1}=2,\\lambda_{2}=1$. 齐次方程的通解为 $y=C_{1}e^{2x}+C_{2}e^{x}$，设非齐次方程的特解为","$y=(Ax+B)xe^{x}$，代入原方程可得，$A=-1,B=-2$. 因此原方程的通解为","$y=C_{1}e^{2x}+C_{2}e^{x}+(-x^{2}-2x)e^{x}$ ($C_{1},C_{2}$ 为任意常数)."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-16","num":16,"desc":"变限积分求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】$f(x)=x^{2}\\int_{1}^{x^{2}}e^{-t^{2}}dt-\\int_{1}^{x^{2}}te^{-t^{2}}dt$, $f'(x)=2x\\int_{1}^{x^{2}}e^{-t^{2}}dt$. 令 $f'(x)=2x\\int_{1}^{x^{2}}e^{-t^{2}}dt=0$,","解得 $x=0$，$\\pm1$. 在区间 $(-1,0)$，$(1,+\\infty)$，$f'(x)\\geqslant0$，函数 $f(x)$ 单调递增，在区间","$(-\\infty,-1)$，$(0,1)$，$f'(x)\\leqslant0$，函数 $f(x)$ 单调递减. 所以在 $x=1,x=-1$ 处取得极","小值：$f(1)=f(-1)=0$；在 $x=0$ 取得极大值：$f(0)=\\dfrac{1}{2}(1-\\dfrac{1}{e})$."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-17","num":17,"desc":"定积分的大小比较","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】","（I）令 $f(t)=\\ln(1+t)-t$，当 $0\\leqslant t\\leqslant1$ 时，$f'(t)=\\dfrac{1}{1+t}-1\\leqslant0$","故当 $0\\leqslant t\\leqslant1$ 时 $f(t)\\leqslant f(0)=0$，即 $0\\leqslant t\\leqslant1$ 时，$0\\leqslant\\ln(1+t)\\leqslant t$,","从而 $\\left(\\ln(1+t)\\right)^{n}\\leqslant t^{n}(n=1,2,\\cdots)$ 又由 $|\\ln t|\\geqslant0$,","得 $\\int_{0}^{1}|\\ln t|\\left[\\ln(1+t)\\right]^{n}dt<\\int_{0}^{1}t^{n}|\\ln t|dt (n=1,2,\\cdots).$","（II）$\\int_{0}^{1}|\\ln t|t^{n}dt=-\\int_{0}^{1}(\\ln t)t^{n}dt=-\\left.(\\ln t)\\dfrac{1}{n+1}t^{n+1}\\right|_{0}^{1}+\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{1}{n+1}t^{n}dt=\\dfrac{1}{(n+1)^{2}}$","$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{0}^{1}|\\ln t|t^{n}dt=0$, 又 $M_{n}\\geqslant0$, 所以由夹逼准则得 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{0}^{1}|\\ln t|\\left[\\ln(1+t)\\right]^{n}dt=0.$"]}]},{"id":"math-2010-18","num":18,"desc":"幂级数收敛域","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{u_{n+1}(x)}{u_{n}(x)}\\right|=\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{x^{2n+2}(2n-1)}{x^{2n}(2n+1)}\\right|=x^{2}$，所以当 $x^{2}<1$ 即 $-1<x<1$ 时，原幂","级数绝对收敛；当 $x=\\pm1$ 时，级数为 $\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^{n-1}}{2n-1}$，根据莱布尼兹判别法知此级数收敛,","故原幂级数的收敛域为 $[-1,1]$.","由题意可设 $s(x)=\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^{n-1}}{2n-1}x^{2n}$，则 $s(x)=\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^{n-1}}{2n-1}x^{2n}=x\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^{n-1}}{2n-1}x^{2n-1}$，令","$\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^{n-1}}{2n-1}x^{2n-1}=f(x), x\\in[-1,1]$，则 $f'(x)=\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n-1}x^{2(n-1)}=\\dfrac{1}{1+x^{2}}$.","因为 $f(0)=0$，所以 $f(x)=\\int_{0}^{x}f'(t)dt+f(0)=\\arctan x$，从而可得","$s(x)=x\\arctan x, x\\in[-1,1]$, 收敛域 $x\\in[-1,1]$, 和函数 $s(x)=x\\arctan x$."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-19","num":19,"desc":"曲面的切平面法向量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】切平面法向量 $F_{x}=2x, F_{y}=2y-z, F_{z}=2z-y$，$xoy$ 面的法向量为 $(0,0,1)$,","因 $S$ 在点 $P$ 处的切平面与 $xOy$ 面垂直. 所以 $2x\\times0+(2y-z)\\times0+(2z-y)\\times1=0\\Rightarrow z=\\dfrac{y}{2}.$","所以轨迹 $C$ 为 $\\begin{cases}x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}-yz=1\\\\ y=2z\\end{cases}$ 即 $\\begin{cases}2z-y=0\\\\ x^{2}+\\dfrac{3}{4}y^{2}=1\\end{cases}$ 取 $D_{xy}=\\left\\{(x,y)\\Big|x^{2}+\\dfrac{3}{4}y^{2}\\leqslant1\\right\\}$,","由于 $dS=\\sqrt{1+z_{x}^{2}+z_{y}^{2}}dxdy=\\sqrt{1+\\left(\\dfrac{2x}{y-2z}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\dfrac{2y-z}{y-2z}\\right)^{2}}dxdy$","$=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{4x^{2}+5y^{2}+5z^{2}-8yz}}{|y-2z|}dxdy=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{4+y^{2}+z^{2}-4yz}}{|y-2z|}dxdy$","所以，原式 $=\\iint\\limits_{D_{xy}}\\dfrac{(x+\\sqrt{3})|y-2z|}{\\sqrt{4+y^{2}+z^{2}-4yz}}\\cdot\\dfrac{\\sqrt{4+y^{2}+z^{2}-4yz}}{|y-2z|}dxdy=\\iint\\limits_{D_{xy}}\\left(x+\\sqrt{3}\\right)dxdy$","$=\\iint\\limits_{D_{xy}}xdxdy+\\iint\\limits_{D_{xy}}\\sqrt{3}dxdy=0+\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\pi\\cdot1\\cdot\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}=2\\pi$."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-20","num":20,"desc":"含参非齐次线性方程组","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】（I）由 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{b}$ 存在 2 个不同的解，可知 $R(\\boldsymbol{A})=R(\\boldsymbol{A}\\!\\vdots\\,\\boldsymbol{b})<3$","对 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{b}$ 的增广矩阵做初等行变换,","$\\bar{\\boldsymbol{A}}=(\\boldsymbol{A}\\!\\vdots\\,\\boldsymbol{b})=\\begin{pmatrix}\\lambda&1&1&\\vdots&a\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&0&\\vdots&1\\\\ 1&1&\\lambda&\\vdots&1\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow{\\;r_{1}\\leftrightarrow r_{3}\\;}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&\\lambda&\\vdots&1\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&0&\\vdots&1\\\\ \\lambda&1&1&\\vdots&a\\end{pmatrix}$","$\\xrightarrow{\\;r_{3}-\\lambda r_{1}\\;}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&\\lambda&\\vdots&1\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&0&\\vdots&1\\\\ 0&1-\\lambda&1-\\lambda^{2}&\\vdots&a-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow{\\;r_{3}+r_{2}\\;}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&\\lambda&\\vdots&1\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&0&\\vdots&1\\\\ 0&0&1-\\lambda^{2}&\\vdots&a+1-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}$","所以 $\\begin{cases}1-\\lambda^{2}=0\\\\ a+1-\\lambda=0\\end{cases}$，解得 $\\lambda=1,a=0$ （舍去）；$\\lambda=-1,a=-2$.","（II）由（I）知，$\\bar{\\boldsymbol{A}}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&-1&\\vdots&1\\\\ 0&-2&0&\\vdots&1\\\\ 0&0&0&\\vdots&0\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1&\\vdots&1.5\\\\ 0&1&0&\\vdots&-0.5\\\\ 0&0&0&\\vdots&0\\end{pmatrix}$,","$R(\\boldsymbol{A})=R(\\bar{\\boldsymbol{A}})=2$, 对应齐次线性方程组 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 的基础解系含 1 个解向量，即 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$,","$\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{b}$ 的一个特解为 $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{3}{2}\\\\ -\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}$, $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{b}$ 的通解为 $k\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{3}{2}\\\\ -\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}$（其中 $k$ 为任意常数）."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-21","num":21,"desc":"实对称矩阵对角化","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】","（I）由题意知矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的特征值为 1,1,0, 且特征值 0 对应的特征向量为 $\\left(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},0,\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)^{T}$,","$\\boldsymbol{Q}^{T}\\boldsymbol{AQ}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&&\\\\ &1&\\\\ &&0\\end{pmatrix}$, 设特征值 1 对应的特征向量为 $(x_{1},x_{2},x_{3})^{T}$，则","$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot x_{1}+0\\cdot x_{2}+\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot x_{3}=0$，求解得特征值 1 对应的特征向量为","$(0,1,0)^{T},(1,0,-1)^{T}$，将其单位化得 $(0,1,0)^{T},\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}},0,-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^{T}.$","$\\boldsymbol{Q}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}&\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\ 1&0&0\\\\ 0&-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}&\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{pmatrix}$, $\\boldsymbol{Q}^{T}=\\boldsymbol{Q}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&0\\\\ \\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}&0&-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\ \\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}&0&\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{pmatrix}$,","$\\boldsymbol{A}=\\boldsymbol{Q}\\Lambda\\boldsymbol{Q}^{T}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}&\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\ 1&0&0\\\\ 0&-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}&\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&&\\\\ &1&\\\\ &&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&0\\\\ \\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}&0&-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\ \\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}&0&\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{1}{2}&0&-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\ 0&1&0\\\\ -\\dfrac{1}{2}&0&\\dfrac{1}{2}\\end{pmatrix}.$","（II）证明：$\\left(\\boldsymbol{A}+\\boldsymbol{E}\\right)^{T}=\\boldsymbol{A}^{T}+\\boldsymbol{E}=\\boldsymbol{A}+\\boldsymbol{E}$, , $\\boldsymbol{A}+\\boldsymbol{E}$ 为实对称矩阵. 又 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的特征值为 1,1,0,","$\\boldsymbol{A}+\\boldsymbol{E}$ 的特征值为 2,2,1，都大于 0，$\\boldsymbol{A}+\\boldsymbol{E}$ 为正定矩阵."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-22","num":22,"desc":"二维随机变量的联合密度","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】由概率密度的性质 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}f(x,y)dxdy=1$，可知","$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}Ae^{-2x^{2}+2xy-y^{2}}dxdy=A\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-x^{2}}dx\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-(x-y)^{2}}dy=1.$","又知 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-x^{2}}dx=\\sqrt{\\pi}$，有 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-x^{2}}dx\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-(x-y)^{2}}dy=\\pi$，所以 $A=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}$，即","$f(x,y)=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}e^{-2x^{2}+2xy-y^{2}}$，$X$ 的边缘概率密度为","$f_{X}(x)=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}e^{-x^{2}}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-(x-y)^{2}}dy=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}e^{-x^{2}}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\pi}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}e^{-x^{2}}, -\\infty<x<+\\infty$,","$f_{Y|X}(y|x)=\\dfrac{f(x,y)}{f_{X}(x)}=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}e^{-2x^{2}+2xy-y^{2}}}{\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}e^{-x^{2}}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}e^{-(x-y)^{2}}, -\\infty<x<+\\infty, -\\infty<y<+\\infty$."]}]},{"id":"math-2010-23","num":23,"desc":"二项分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】由题知 $N_{1},N_{2},N_{3}$ 分别服从二项分布 $B(n,1-\\theta), B(n,\\theta-\\theta^{2}), B(n,\\theta^{2})$，则有","$EN_{1}=n(1-\\theta), EN_{2}=n(\\theta-\\theta^{2}), EN_{3}=n\\theta^{2}$,","$ET=E(\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{3}a_{i}N_{i})=\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{3}a_{i}EN_{i}=a_{1}n(1-\\theta)+a_{2}n(\\theta-\\theta^{2})+a_{3}n\\theta^{2}=\\theta$","$\\Rightarrow\\begin{cases}a_{1}n=0\\\\ a_{2}n-a_{1}n=1\\\\ a_{3}n-a_{2}n=0\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow\\begin{cases}a_{1}=0\\\\ a_{2}=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\\\ a_{3}=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\end{cases}$","即 $T=\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{3}a_{i}N_{i}=\\dfrac{N_{2}+N_{3}}{n}=\\dfrac{n-N_{1}}{n}=1-\\dfrac{N_{1}}{n}$,","$DT=D(1-\\dfrac{N_{1}}{n})=\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}DN_{1}=\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}\\times n(1-\\theta)\\theta=\\dfrac{(1-\\theta)\\theta}{n}$."]}]}]}